WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.650
standup dashboard. App demo with synthetic data. Fictional users served from a local cache. No GitHub request was made.

2
00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:04.350
Type a GitHub username and load the dashboard

3
00:00:04.400 --> 00:00:06.150
PRs, issues and activity fill in on one screen

4
00:00:06.200 --> 00:00:09.050
A streak and per-repo numbers from stored history

5
00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.850
Per-repo health with day-over-day deltas

6
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:14.500
Deltas come from stored snapshots, not in-memory guesses

7
00:00:14.550 --> 00:00:16.050
Switch to a second user

8
00:00:16.100 --> 00:00:19.350
One section hits a rate limit, every other section still renders

9
00:00:19.500 --> 00:00:22.050
standup dashboard. Real app running locally on synthetic cache rows. No GitHub calls.

